    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d21-a1">

                <pb facs="0128" n="22" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg22"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 183.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Janowitz to Mr. Grant</hi>.</head>
                <p>As you advised me, I beg leave to inform you that I was officially requested to
                    appear before the military commission July 6. Kindly assist and inform me and
                    oblige,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alfred Janowitz</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
